(6720938, 1005740, 124190, '<td valign="top">Dude....that''s an Unyum. Funny.....my eyes sting like hell when I wear my glasses chopping onions.   But when I wear my contacts.....ehhhhh...no problem!<br/> <br/>Anyway.  interesting lighting...the more I stare at it...the more my eyes burn.... (that''s a good thing)<br/> <br/>Your IDEA holds my interest long enough to try to understand if you are being sentimental.....or tongue in cheek.  Honestly I am NOT being sarcastic or anything.   I''m just stuck on this picture....can''t quite find the words or questions I''m looking for.         The blur is cool.    ALSO...have you noticed how much they charge for a "peeled" purple onion at the grocery store compared to a regular "unpeeled" onion.....what''s with THAT?   High mark for your photo......show an incredible amount of vulnerability.....  Having gone through the challenge twice  I come back to this and appreciate the creativity behind and in it.....so much better than the rest.</td>', 'Dude....that''s an Unyum. Funny.....my eyes sting like hell when I wear my glasses chopping onions.   But when I wear my contacts.....ehhhhh...no problem! Anyway.  interesting lighting...the more I stare at it...the more my eyes burn.... (that''s a good thing) Your IDEA holds my interest long enough to try to understand if you are being sentimental.....or tongue in cheek.  Honestly I am NOT being sarcastic or anything.   I''m just stuck on this picture....can''t quite find the words or questions I''m looking for.         The blur is cool.    ALSO...have you noticed how much they charge for a "peeled" purple onion at the grocery store compared to a regular "unpeeled" onion.....what''s with THAT?   High mark for your photo......show an incredible amount of vulnerability.....  Having gone through the challenge twice  I come back to this and appreciate the creativity behind and in it.....so much better than the rest.', '2012-03-23 09:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
