(6721579, 1005804, 16106, '<td valign="top">My favorite concept of the challenge, it may not have the eye candy appeal to get on the front page, but it is clever clever clever.</td>', 'My favorite concept of the challenge, it may not have the eye candy appeal to get on the front page, but it is clever clever clever.', '2012-03-23 20:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
