(6721590, 1005716, 16106, '<td valign="top">it is hard to make a flat subject jump, but you did it with this lighting. Clever concept combining two key ideas and nice processing to bring out the tones in the keys while keeping the paper white.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-03-30 00:21:50.</i></td>', 'it is hard to make a flat subject jump, but you did it with this lighting. Clever concept combining two key ideas and nice processing to bring out the tones in the keys while keeping the paper white.', '2012-03-23 20:30:22.000000', '2012-03-30 01:21:50.000000', 1),
