(6723366, 1005856, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the DOF here.  Nice silver and gray/black colors.  The words seem to be a little OOF, but perhaps that''s what you wanted?  I would have liked to had seen it a little more in focus.  JMO</td>', 'Love the DOF here.  Nice silver and gray/black colors.  The words seem to be a little OOF, but perhaps that''s what you wanted?  I would have liked to had seen it a little more in focus.  JMO', '2012-03-26 16:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
