(6723371, 1005827, 134859, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet intriguing.  Great title.  Nice placement of the keys in relation to the glasses.  Good lighting.  And love the black and white conversion.  Well done.</td>', 'Simple, yet intriguing.  Great title.  Nice placement of the keys in relation to the glasses.  Good lighting.  And love the black and white conversion.  Well done.', '2012-03-26 16:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723380, 1005437, 134859, '<td valign="top">Interesting way to go about the challenge.  Nice title.  Like the overgrown brush.  Beautiful detail and black and white.</td>', 'Interesting way to go about the challenge.  Nice title.  Like the overgrown brush.  Beautiful detail and black and white.', '2012-03-26 16:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723382, 1005144, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice effect here.  Good title.  Love the color.  Makes me a little dizzy if I stare for too long tho, lol.  Well done</td>', 'Nice effect here.  Good title.  Love the color.  Makes me a little dizzy if I stare for too long tho, lol.  Well done', '2012-03-26 16:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723390, 1005805, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful DOF in this shot.  Love the black and white conversion.  The only thing that throws me off in the shot is the bright blurred spot in the left of the frame... what is that?  Maybe if it wasn''t there, it wouldn''t be as distracting.  Nice shot though!  :)</td>', 'Beautiful DOF in this shot.  Love the black and white conversion.  The only thing that throws me off in the shot is the bright blurred spot in the left of the frame... what is that?  Maybe if it wasn''t there, it wouldn''t be as distracting.  Nice shot though!  :)', '2012-03-26 16:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723430, 1005778, 134859, '<td valign="top">The shelves look like the shot glass holder we have.  Very interesting idea here!  I like this.  Nice focus, good black and white conversion.  well done.</td>', 'The shelves look like the shot glass holder we have.  Very interesting idea here!  I like this.  Nice focus, good black and white conversion.  well done.', '2012-03-26 17:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723432, 1005815, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the idea of this.  The lighting works great. The key bending is wonderful.  The black and white really works here!</td>', 'Love the idea of this.  The lighting works great. The key bending is wonderful.  The black and white really works here!', '2012-03-26 17:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723469, 1004837, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice clean, classic shot.  Love the black and white, the detail, the focus.  Very well done.  And LOVE that it isn''t a typical set of keys.</td>', 'Nice clean, classic shot.  Love the black and white, the detail, the focus.  Very well done.  And LOVE that it isn''t a typical set of keys.', '2012-03-26 18:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723470, 1005508, 134859, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  Looks like someone is attempting to break in somewhere.  Very interesting.</td>', 'Good shot.  Looks like someone is attempting to break in somewhere.  Very interesting.', '2012-03-26 18:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723505, 1005733, 117474, '<td valign="top">My only 10. Love it.</td>', 'My only 10. Love it.', '2012-03-26 19:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723509, 1005437, 22988, '<td valign="top">I love this photo!</td>', 'I love this photo!', '2012-03-26 19:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723585, 1005775, 143659, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of this challenge. Im sure this is a ribbon. The lighting is great, the over exposed sunglasses and reflection is perfect. You even catch a little twinkle on your right hand bouncing from the piano key.</td>', 'This is my favorite of this challenge. Im sure this is a ribbon. The lighting is great, the over exposed sunglasses and reflection is perfect. You even catch a little twinkle on your right hand bouncing from the piano key.', '2012-03-26 21:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723589, 1005709, 143659, '<td valign="top">I like this picture. I wonder how it would look opening it more so part of the key started showing.</td>', 'I like this picture. I wonder how it would look opening it more so part of the key started showing.', '2012-03-26 21:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723913, 1005847, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is so different and interesting.  I like that you have chosen to do something that wasn''t a normal key.  <br/>Great shot, love the colors.  Good luck with it.</td>', 'This is so different and interesting.  I like that you have chosen to do something that wasn''t a normal key.  Great shot, love the colors.  Good luck with it.', '2012-03-27 10:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723914, 1005807, 134859, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I know the anxiety he''s feeling.  Having one of driving age, and one who is going through drivers ed this year... I can feel the gray hairs coming on!  lol<br/> <br/>Great shot.  Love the angle.  And the looks on both of their faces are priceless.</td>', 'Yeah, I know the anxiety he''s feeling.  Having one of driving age, and one who is going through drivers ed this year... I can feel the gray hairs coming on!  lol Great shot.  Love the angle.  And the looks on both of their faces are priceless.', '2012-03-27 10:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723915, 1005092, 134859, '<td valign="top">Cute angle.  Great close up.</td>', 'Cute angle.  Great close up.', '2012-03-27 10:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723919, 1005804, 124190, '<td valign="top">Creative........I was like....ok.....why does the Sahara have mountains and why are they so regular and even......then OMG.......I''m NOT a Valley Gurl...I''m a "keywhiz"!    10</td>', 'Creative........I was like....ok.....why does the Sahara have mountains and why are they so regular and even......then OMG.......I''m NOT a Valley Gurl...I''m a "keywhiz"!    10', '2012-03-27 10:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723920, 1005859, 124190, '<td valign="top">Ruffles have rldges......</td>', 'Ruffles have rldges......', '2012-03-27 10:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723921, 1005062, 124190, '<td valign="top">That''s for sure............   WOW.</td>', 'That''s for sure............   WOW.', '2012-03-27 10:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723922, 1005600, 124190, '<td valign="top">CUTE!</td>', 'CUTE!', '2012-03-27 10:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723924, 1005508, 124190, '<td valign="top">Very cool.....</td>', 'Very cool.....', '2012-03-27 10:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723954, 1005768, 134859, '<td valign="top">Not sure the lighting does this photo justice.  Also, perhaps a different angle would have made it more appealing?  <br/>I like the idea, just think with a little tweaking, it could have looked much better.  JMO</td>', 'Not sure the lighting does this photo justice.  Also, perhaps a different angle would have made it more appealing?  I like the idea, just think with a little tweaking, it could have looked much better.  JMO', '2012-03-27 11:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723956, 1005738, 134859, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  The fact that this is a key challenge, and you didn''t pick a normal "key".  The fact that it is a key on a keyboard/typewriter.  The fact that it actually says "key".  Interesting, different, outside of the box.  Nice lighting and DOF.  Very well done.</td>', 'I really like this.  The fact that this is a key challenge, and you didn''t pick a normal "key".  The fact that it is a key on a keyboard/typewriter.  The fact that it actually says "key".  Interesting, different, outside of the box.  Nice lighting and DOF.  Very well done.', '2012-03-27 11:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723958, 1004838, 134859, '<td valign="top">This shot seems a little over-warm to me (if that makes sense).  Perhaps it''s the strong gold tones, and the lighting to the left of the frame.  Also, I think that it was cropped a little too much, being that the top is barely chopped off. <br/>Did you try this in black and white?  I think that may have done better.  But that''s just my opinion.  :)<br/>Overall, I like the keys and the idea.  Good luck.  :)</td>', 'This shot seems a little over-warm to me (if that makes sense).  Perhaps it''s the strong gold tones, and the lighting to the left of the frame.  Also, I think that it was cropped a little too much, being that the top is barely chopped off. Did you try this in black and white?  I think that may have done better.  But that''s just my opinion.  :)Overall, I like the keys and the idea.  Good luck.  :)', '2012-03-27 11:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723959, 1005113, 134859, '<td valign="top">Like the idea here.  I think it <i>may</i> have done better with a key in the door?  Did you attempt that?  <br/>I like the grunge, old look here.  The rust adds to the shot, and the angle is well chosen.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Like the idea here.  I think it may have done better with a key in the door?  Did you attempt that?  I like the grunge, old look here.  The rust adds to the shot, and the angle is well chosen.  Nicely done.', '2012-03-27 11:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723961, 1005062, 134859, '<td valign="top">Wonderful close up.  I like the amount of detail that was captured here.  I would like to see an outtake of this in black and white, perhaps with some extra sharpness?  <br/>Just a suggestion to another way to go about it.<br/>Like the shot, and the idea.  Nice title as well.  <br/>Well done.</td>', 'Wonderful close up.  I like the amount of detail that was captured here.  I would like to see an outtake of this in black and white, perhaps with some extra sharpness?  Just a suggestion to another way to go about it.Like the shot, and the idea.  Nice title as well.  Well done.', '2012-03-27 11:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723962, 1005716, 134859, '<td valign="top">Outside of the box, definitely.  Like the idea.  Haven''t seen anything like it in the challenge thus far.  <br/>Well done.</td>', 'Outside of the box, definitely.  Like the idea.  Haven''t seen anything like it in the challenge thus far.  Well done.', '2012-03-27 11:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723963, 1005803, 134859, '<td valign="top">I like the shot overall.  I think that if there was some blur to the gauges at the top, it would have made the keys pool  Also, there seems to be a reflection of light on the keychain (the silver part), throwing it off a little for me.  <br/>This is a great idea and I hope it does well for you.</td>', 'I like the shot overall.  I think that if there was some blur to the gauges at the top, it would have made the keys pool  Also, there seems to be a reflection of light on the keychain (the silver part), throwing it off a little for me.  This is a great idea and I hope it does well for you.', '2012-03-27 11:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723964, 1005354, 134859, '<td valign="top">So different.  I love that you''ve used a photographic technique, rather than an actual key, for this challenge.  I am sure there will be people who are going to say DNMC... but I like this.  It makes you wonder, it makes you think... and it''s a beautiful photo.</td>', 'So different.  I love that you''ve used a photographic technique, rather than an actual key, for this challenge.  I am sure there will be people who are going to say DNMC... but I like this.  It makes you wonder, it makes you think... and it''s a beautiful photo.', '2012-03-27 11:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723965, 1005775, 134859, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  LOVE the darkness with the light.  Seems to be some dust that could have been cloned out near the light... but other than that... I don''t think I wouldn''t have done anything else differently.  Good job</td>', 'Lovely shot.  LOVE the darkness with the light.  Seems to be some dust that could have been cloned out near the light... but other than that... I don''t think I wouldn''t have done anything else differently.  Good job', '2012-03-27 11:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723966, 1005763, 134859, '<td valign="top">The title says it all.  Nice shot, good angle.  Well done.</td>', 'The title says it all.  Nice shot, good angle.  Well done.', '2012-03-27 11:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723967, 1005845, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity of this.  Very clean background and the shadow adds that little extra bit of interest.  Good lighting and detail as well.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'Love the simplicity of this.  Very clean background and the shadow adds that little extra bit of interest.  Good lighting and detail as well.  Very nicely done.', '2012-03-27 11:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723977, 1005601, 134859, '<td valign="top">The shot looks a little off, balance wise.  Tilted just a bit.  I would straighten slightly, if it were my shot. <br/>But I like the color conversion and the overall darkness vs. lightness to this.  <br/>Nice focus and DOF.  Still trying to figure out exactly what/where this is.  <br/>Nicely shot and composed</td>', 'The shot looks a little off, balance wise.  Tilted just a bit.  I would straighten slightly, if it were my shot. But I like the color conversion and the overall darkness vs. lightness to this.  Nice focus and DOF.  Still trying to figure out exactly what/where this is.  Nicely shot and composed', '2012-03-27 11:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723978, 1005752, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Love the different types of keys.  Lighting looks just a touch too bright/harsh.  But there is a wonderful amount of detail, and love all the gold tones.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Love the different types of keys.  Lighting looks just a touch too bright/harsh.  But there is a wonderful amount of detail, and love all the gold tones.', '2012-03-27 11:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723979, 1005859, 134859, '<td valign="top">wonderful DOF.  Nice detail.  Simple, yet effective.</td>', 'wonderful DOF.  Nice detail.  Simple, yet effective.', '2012-03-27 11:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723980, 1005115, 134859, '<td valign="top">Haha... WONDERFUL idea.  I like what you''ve done with the keys... having the one key as a shadow, like it''s walking in on them.  The idea is genius!  Hope this is doing well for you.  <br/>Oh, and the DOF is spot on!  Well shot and composed!!!</td>', 'Haha... WONDERFUL idea.  I like what you''ve done with the keys... having the one key as a shadow, like it''s walking in on them.  The idea is genius!  Hope this is doing well for you.  Oh, and the DOF is spot on!  Well shot and composed!!!', '2012-03-27 11:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723983, 1005724, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice idea here.  I like the title, and the colors involved.  The water splash and ripples add extra interest to the shot.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Nice idea here.  I like the title, and the colors involved.  The water splash and ripples add extra interest to the shot.  Nicely done.', '2012-03-27 11:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723984, 1005740, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea.  I like that it''s blurred some... almost like the viewer has water in their eyes (from the smell of the onion).  This is a great shot, and wonderful idea, and something different.  Well done</td>', 'This is a great idea.  I like that it''s blurred some... almost like the viewer has water in their eyes (from the smell of the onion).  This is a great shot, and wonderful idea, and something different.  Well done', '2012-03-27 11:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723986, 1005708, 134859, '<td valign="top">Too cute.  Love the pup in the shot.  Beautiful black and white.  Nice detail and DOF  The tilt of the dog''s head is just perfect.</td>', 'Too cute.  Love the pup in the shot.  Beautiful black and white.  Nice detail and DOF  The tilt of the dog''s head is just perfect.', '2012-03-27 11:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723989, 1005273, 134859, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this shot, but originally, my attention was drawn to the center of the shot.  Perhaps that''s because there is so much darkness in the wood right there.  I think that if the right of the key would have been darkened, and the left of the frame (which contains the board with the key, handle, etc) would have been as bright as it currently is, it would have drawn my attention better.  <br/>Perhaps blurring the right boards as well would have improved the focus point, which should be the key.  <br/>Overall, I think this is a good shot, but with a few adjustments, it could be even better. <br/>Just some suggestions to take into consideration (if you want).</td>', 'I like the idea of this shot, but originally, my attention was drawn to the center of the shot.  Perhaps that''s because there is so much darkness in the wood right there.  I think that if the right of the key would have been darkened, and the left of the frame (which contains the board with the key, handle, etc) would have been as bright as it currently is, it would have drawn my attention better.  Perhaps blurring the right boards as well would have improved the focus point, which should be the key.  Overall, I think this is a good shot, but with a few adjustments, it could be even better. Just some suggestions to take into consideration (if you want).', '2012-03-27 11:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723990, 1005552, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the textures in this shot... the brass against denim.  The colors work wonderfully together, as the stitching in the jean pocket is pulled out even more by the gold and silver toned keys.  <br/>Perhaps including a little more in the shot, like the entire rear end of the person, and focusing on the keys themselves, would have been another interesting shot.  <br/>Overall, very nicely done.</td>', 'Love the textures in this shot... the brass against denim.  The colors work wonderfully together, as the stitching in the jean pocket is pulled out even more by the gold and silver toned keys.  Perhaps including a little more in the shot, like the entire rear end of the person, and focusing on the keys themselves, would have been another interesting shot.  Overall, very nicely done.', '2012-03-27 11:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723991, 1004859, 134859, '<td valign="top">Such a brilliant idea.  I am loving the way this looks like the barrel of a gun, the DOF of this is perfect to pull this shot off.  <br/>Detail is wonderful... darkness works.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Such a brilliant idea.  I am loving the way this looks like the barrel of a gun, the DOF of this is perfect to pull this shot off.  Detail is wonderful... darkness works.  Nicely done.', '2012-03-27 11:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723993, 1005756, 134859, '<td valign="top">The black and white background/foreground is a great contrast to look at, visually, it''s appealing.  I like the keys being the only thing around... very simplistic, yet clean.  <br/>The detail is well shown.  I don''t know of anything I would have done differently in this shot.  <br/>In my opinion, well done.</td>', 'The black and white background/foreground is a great contrast to look at, visually, it''s appealing.  I like the keys being the only thing around... very simplistic, yet clean.  The detail is well shown.  I don''t know of anything I would have done differently in this shot.  In my opinion, well done.', '2012-03-27 11:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723994, 1004945, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea.  I was thinking of doing something similar with my shot, but alas, I didn''t.<br/>I think this shot is a bit OOF... and the colors are somewhat flat.  <br/>I do like the close up, the way she is holding the necklace, and the idea, but there should be a few minor adjustments to really make it pop, IMO, that is</td>', 'This is a great idea.  I was thinking of doing something similar with my shot, but alas, I didn''t.I think this shot is a bit OOF... and the colors are somewhat flat.  I do like the close up, the way she is holding the necklace, and the idea, but there should be a few minor adjustments to really make it pop, IMO, that is', '2012-03-27 11:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723995, 1005547, 134859, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  Looks like the white balance may be a little off.  And the angle isn''t doing the shot justice.  But I do like the idea.</td>', 'Cute idea.  Looks like the white balance may be a little off.  And the angle isn''t doing the shot justice.  But I do like the idea.', '2012-03-27 11:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723996, 1005186, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I''m on the fence about whether I like, or don''t like, the DOF here.  Part of me is wanting to see the front keys in focus... while the other part finds that the back keys being in focus in very different and interesting.  <br/>Maybe if the middle was more in focus, or the front wasn''t so blurred?  I just don''t know.  <br/>I do like that this shot isn''t your normal "key" shot, however.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I''m on the fence about whether I like, or don''t like, the DOF here.  Part of me is wanting to see the front keys in focus... while the other part finds that the back keys being in focus in very different and interesting.  Maybe if the middle was more in focus, or the front wasn''t so blurred?  I just don''t know.  I do like that this shot isn''t your normal "key" shot, however.', '2012-03-27 11:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6724000, 1005097, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is different.  Not sure what a key has to do with an orange?  Trying to find the hidden meaning.  Perhaps after the challenge it will be revealed, or, maybe that''s just the setup you went with.  <br/>The colors seem a little flat and the white balance looks a little off.  <br/>JMO</td>', 'This is different.  Not sure what a key has to do with an orange?  Trying to find the hidden meaning.  Perhaps after the challenge it will be revealed, or, maybe that''s just the setup you went with.  The colors seem a little flat and the white balance looks a little off.  JMO', '2012-03-27 11:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6724004, 1005732, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the idea of evolution of keys.  Makes me look and think how things have changed so much!  We lost our keyless entry, so I''m sitting between the second and third key, myself.  lol.<br/>The shadows are a bit distracting.  And the light is harsh on the key to the far right... <br/>But I like this idea and setup.</td>', 'Love the idea of evolution of keys.  Makes me look and think how things have changed so much!  We lost our keyless entry, so I''m sitting between the second and third key, myself.  lol.The shadows are a bit distracting.  And the light is harsh on the key to the far right... But I like this idea and setup.', '2012-03-27 11:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6724006, 1005591, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the idea.  There are so many latchkey children in this world nowadays.  Great title and angle.  Like the noise/grain in the shot as well.</td>', 'Love the idea.  There are so many latchkey children in this world nowadays.  Great title and angle.  Like the noise/grain in the shot as well.', '2012-03-27 11:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6724007, 1005776, 134859, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  <br/>What I like:<br/>The key being very in focus<br/>The key having a decent amount of detail<br/>The key being the only thing in the frame<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>The color seems a little over saturated<br/>There looks like there is haloing (or the lighting is off, not sure which)<br/>The greenish tint<br/> <br/>I think this is interesting and a good shot overall, just a few things I didn''t like, but that''s just my opinion.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  What I like:The key being very in focusThe key having a decent amount of detailThe key being the only thing in the frame What I don''t like:The color seems a little over saturatedThere looks like there is haloing (or the lighting is off, not sure which)The greenish tint I think this is interesting and a good shot overall, just a few things I didn''t like, but that''s just my opinion.', '2012-03-27 11:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6724008, 1005195, 134859, '<td valign="top">LMAO.  I think I laughed the hardest at this shot.  <br/>I love the idea.  <br/>I am sure you have gotten some DNMC responses... but who cares.  <br/> <br/>I think perhaps a little more sharpness and blacks, and the shot would have been perfect.</td>', 'LMAO.  I think I laughed the hardest at this shot.  I love the idea.  I am sure you have gotten some DNMC responses... but who cares.   I think perhaps a little more sharpness and blacks, and the shot would have been perfect.', '2012-03-27 11:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6724009, 1005855, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I think the focus is a little off, and I''m not feeling the upside-downness to the shot.  JMO</td>', 'Nice idea.  I think the focus is a little off, and I''m not feeling the upside-downness to the shot.  JMO', '2012-03-27 12:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6724022, 1005256, 134859, '<td valign="top">Like the idea.  Looks a lot like my keychain... lots of stuff on it.  Love the title.  Lighting seems to be a touch off, perhaps?</td>', 'Like the idea.  Looks a lot like my keychain... lots of stuff on it.  Love the title.  Lighting seems to be a touch off, perhaps?', '2012-03-27 12:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
