(6724028, 1005828, 134859, '<td valign="top">Not sure I get this shot.  I have looked at it time and time and time again.  Why am I not understanding?  <br/>I like the black and white and the uniqueness to the shot.  <br/>Looking forward to seeing the description after the challenge ends.</td>', 'Not sure I get this shot.  I have looked at it time and time and time again.  Why am I not understanding?  I like the black and white and the uniqueness to the shot.  Looking forward to seeing the description after the challenge ends.', '2012-03-27 12:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
