(6724247, 1004838, 142473, '<td valign="top">Its a good subject, but I think the composition and lighting is lacking a good bit.  Offset the subject some to increase interest.  Find unique angles.  The lighting from the right is too bright, and overexposed the keys on that side.  Overall, though, a cool subject that reminds me of my old house.  Just a few technical issues to be worked out.</td>', 'Its a good subject, but I think the composition and lighting is lacking a good bit.  Offset the subject some to increase interest.  Find unique angles.  The lighting from the right is too bright, and overexposed the keys on that side.  Overall, though, a cool subject that reminds me of my old house.  Just a few technical issues to be worked out.', '2012-03-27 17:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
