(6725124, 1005738, 117717, '<td valign="top">Like your ''key'' idea, nice focus, b&amp;w suits this subject.  Love old typewriters!</td>', 'Like your ''key'' idea, nice focus, b&w suits this subject.  Love old typewriters!', '2012-03-28 11:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725315, 1005732, 145662, '<td valign="top">Very cool, good title</td>', 'Very cool, good title', '2012-03-28 14:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725472, 1005733, 16106, '<td valign="top">Somewhere between Jerry Ulesman and Wes Craven lies an image, and this is it. Dark, brooding, somber, lovely, lovely, lovely. The degree of clarity of the key is a bit much, it feels like you pulled it up a bit too strongly in contrast since the blacks there are so much deeper than in the face, so it seems to hop up into the plane of the window instead of sitting behind it. One niggle in a best in show image.</td>', 'Somewhere between Jerry Ulesman and Wes Craven lies an image, and this is it. Dark, brooding, somber, lovely, lovely, lovely. The degree of clarity of the key is a bit much, it feels like you pulled it up a bit too strongly in contrast since the blacks there are so much deeper than in the face, so it seems to hop up into the plane of the window instead of sitting behind it. One niggle in a best in show image.', '2012-03-28 17:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725476, 1005763, 16106, '<td valign="top">I like the way you balanced out the stops and the keys, the way you balanced the color of the dust with the color of the gold lettering. A bit more room in the lower right might have helped, that corner seems a bit squeezed to me given the space above the stops. Nice use of a tight DOF.</td>', 'I like the way you balanced out the stops and the keys, the way you balanced the color of the dust with the color of the gold lettering. A bit more room in the lower right might have helped, that corner seems a bit squeezed to me given the space above the stops. Nice use of a tight DOF.', '2012-03-28 17:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725489, 1005768, 16106, '<td valign="top">A lovely collection nicely framed but the lighting lacks drama and the color of that background steals too much attention from the lovely tones in the keys.<br/> <br/>It is sometimes annoying to have others say what they would have done, so stop reading now if you like.<br/> <br/>Had you shot this on a more color neutral background, with that blue light (from the window ?) on the left and a yellow fill light (like a desk lamp) on the right, you would have brought an equal amount of drama in, but the attention would all be on the subject rather than being shared with the background. To really make it DPC friendly you could have hung the keys from fishing line to break the planarity and show off different facets of the keys.</td>', 'A lovely collection nicely framed but the lighting lacks drama and the color of that background steals too much attention from the lovely tones in the keys. It is sometimes annoying to have others say what they would have done, so stop reading now if you like. Had you shot this on a more color neutral background, with that blue light (from the window ?) on the left and a yellow fill light (like a desk lamp) on the right, you would have brought an equal amount of drama in, but the attention would all be on the subject rather than being shared with the background. To really make it DPC friendly you could have hung the keys from fishing line to break the planarity and show off different facets of the keys.', '2012-03-28 18:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725491, 1005827, 16106, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but that big shadow on the right creates too much interest in what is outside the frame casting that shadow. It does give you those cool reflections, but it pulls too much interest away from the keys and the glasses.</td>', 'Nice composition, but that big shadow on the right creates too much interest in what is outside the frame casting that shadow. It does give you those cool reflections, but it pulls too much interest away from the keys and the glasses.', '2012-03-28 18:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725492, 1005841, 16106, '<td valign="top">Simple elegant minimalism. The color balance here is just perfect.</td>', 'Simple elegant minimalism. The color balance here is just perfect.', '2012-03-28 18:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6725672, 1005465, 113278, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. Love how the keys seem to spiral down. Excellent processing as well 10</td>', 'Fantastic. Love how the keys seem to spiral down. Excellent processing as well 10', '2012-03-28 22:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
