(6726324, 1005421, 134859, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  Great detail, nice lighting.  It has an "older" feel.  I would actually hang this on my wall!  Very well done.</td>', 'Lovely shot.  Great detail, nice lighting.  It has an "older" feel.  I would actually hang this on my wall!  Very well done.', '2012-03-29 18:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726325, 1005465, 134859, '<td valign="top">Like the title.  The shot itself is very unique.  I''m not sure if I like it or not... which really makes me take an even longer look... looking for the good and the bad.  But, that''s a good sign, because it means that I am very interested by it.  Rather than putting "nice shot", and moving on, this is not a "meh" shot.  it is more.  <br/>I like the darkness and brighter areas.  The way the keys are placed makes for an inviting visual appearance.  <br/>After further review, I have found that not only do I like the placement of the keys, the lightness and darkness, but also the color conversion, the shadows, the noise... very well done.  9</td>', 'Like the title.  The shot itself is very unique.  I''m not sure if I like it or not... which really makes me take an even longer look... looking for the good and the bad.  But, that''s a good sign, because it means that I am very interested by it.  Rather than putting "nice shot", and moving on, this is not a "meh" shot.  it is more.  I like the darkness and brighter areas.  The way the keys are placed makes for an inviting visual appearance.  After further review, I have found that not only do I like the placement of the keys, the lightness and darkness, but also the color conversion, the shadows, the noise... very well done.  9', '2012-03-29 18:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726326, 1005836, 134859, '<td valign="top">There''s something about this shot that I really like.  I can''t quite put my finger on it.  I guess it''s the combination of the processing, the colors, the DOF, everything.  It''s a wonderful set up shot.  Very well done!</td>', 'There''s something about this shot that I really like.  I can''t quite put my finger on it.  I guess it''s the combination of the processing, the colors, the DOF, everything.  It''s a wonderful set up shot.  Very well done!', '2012-03-29 18:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726327, 1005814, 134859, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, using piano/keyboard keys rather than real keys.  But it appears that the white balance may be off, and it is OOF.  The angle also doesn''t do the shot justice.  <br/>I think if the shot was sharper, more brightness/contrast perhaps, and a different angle, the should could have been more interesting.<br/>JMO</td>', 'I like this idea, using piano/keyboard keys rather than real keys.  But it appears that the white balance may be off, and it is OOF.  The angle also doesn''t do the shot justice.  I think if the shot was sharper, more brightness/contrast perhaps, and a different angle, the should could have been more interesting.JMO', '2012-03-29 18:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6726328, 1005754, 134859, '<td valign="top">What are those things in the background?  Completely black spots... I can''t help but undernt.  <br/>On to the focal point of this... I think the focus isn''t completely there... the lighting isn''t doing the shot justice either, IMO.  <br/>Also, with the title, I would expect this to have a "dreamy" feel... so perhaps a soft focus filter would have improved the effect.<br/>Just some suggestions to take into consideration.</td>', 'What are those things in the background?  Completely black spots... I can''t help but undernt.  On to the focal point of this... I think the focus isn''t completely there... the lighting isn''t doing the shot justice either, IMO.  Also, with the title, I would expect this to have a "dreamy" feel... so perhaps a soft focus filter would have improved the effect.Just some suggestions to take into consideration.', '2012-03-29 18:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
