(6727678, 1005836, 18367, '<td valign="top">Originally posted by Ray:<br/>A date, la plus belle des images. Elle mérite facilement un 9. Bonne chance.<br/> <br/>I have no idea what that means and I am too tired &amp; lazy to look it up, but thanks for the 9! :)<br/> <br/>It means: "To date (until now) this is the nicest of the images I had seen and easily warranted a 9.  Good luck.<br/> <br/>...Mind you, had I told you this over the phone, "un 9" could also be interpreted as "an egg"... funny language French eh?<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your placement Ken, very nicely done.<br/> <br/>Ray</td>', 'Originally posted by Ray:A date, la plus belle des images. Elle mérite facilement un 9. Bonne chance. I have no idea what that means and I am too tired & lazy to look it up, but thanks for the 9! :) It means: "To date (until now) this is the nicest of the images I had seen and easily warranted a 9.  Good luck. ...Mind you, had I told you this over the phone, "un 9" could also be interpreted as "an egg"... funny language French eh? Congratulations on your placement Ken, very nicely done. Ray', '2012-03-31 09:12:05.000000', NULL, 0),
